并且 80%​​ 接受，则将增加约 30 位客人。在上面输入您的加一份额，结果将包含它。","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.summary_text.when_do_i_have_to_give_the_caterer_a_fin.278b2e88":"我什么时候必须向餐饮服务商提供最终号码？","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.p_text.most_us_caterers_want_the_firm_headcount.76364d5b":"大多数美国餐饮服务商都希望在婚礼前 7 至 14 天确定人员数量，而且通常要求很严格。椅子租赁需要 2-4 周，蛋糕需要 2-4 周，座位表打印需要等待最终回复。","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.summary_text.should_children_count_as_full_adult_meal.882732c0":"儿童应该算作成人全餐吗？","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.p_text.many_catering_planners_weight_a_child_s.b80a0232":"许多餐饮策划者将儿童餐的重量定为成人份量的 0.6 左右。结果显示了人数和餐当量数字，因此您可以公平地比较报价。","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.summary_text.does_a_weekday_wedding_change_attendance.58ef041d":"工作日的婚礼会改变出席人数吗？","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.p_text.yes_ranked_guides_put_weekday_weddings_a.b43c69a0":"是的。排名指南显示，平日举行婚礼的人数下降了 20-30%，而当地周六的人数下降了 10-15%，因为客人需要请假或照顾孩子。选择工具中的“工作日”选项对其进行建模。","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.h2_text.more_free_wedding_tools.511ec8cc":"更多免费婚礼工具","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.budget_calculator.4a2217e0":"预算计算器","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.seating_chart.0aa1b5db":"座位表","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.hashtag_generator.f0d774ee":"话题标签生成器","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.invitation_maker.eaa060de":"请柬制作工具","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.save_the_date.f3ad2c82":"婚期预告","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.photo_book_planner.a9887dd0":"照片书策划师","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.photo_collage.942e207a":"照片拼贴","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.heic_to_jpg.67ca8d18":"HEIC 转 JPG","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.planning_checklist.8d9c7c04":"婚礼筹备清单","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.alcohol_calculator.aa6ed7fc":"酒水计算器","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.vow_writer.90e3a3d2":"婚礼誓词撰写工具","tools.wedding-guest-count-calculator.a_text.speech_writer.7bd24d35":"致辞撰写","tools.wedding-guest-count-calcu